<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Health Care raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Health Care raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday it had raised Health Care &amp; Retirement Corp to near-term buy from accumulate and had named it focus stock of the week.</p>
<p>-- The compoany kept its rating of long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the nursing homes, rehabilitation clinics and home care company closed on Wednesday at 29.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
